                                "sense_id": "85e80707-c6ec-361c-838e-fef3b75491f7",
                                "text": "How easy is it, on the other hand, to an enlightened teacher, particularly in the beginning, to elucidate the various forms of rhythm by methodical arrangement in respect of simplicity and increasing complicity or mixture!"
                            }
                        ]
